   "stem_html": "Hernando de Soto saw exploration of the New World as an opportunity to ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1166218,
     "content_html": "improve his social and economic standing within the Spanish empire"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166217,
     "content_html": "bring the technological improvements of Europe to Native Americans"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166216,
     "content_html": "unite Native American tribes such as the Inca and Aztecs"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166215,
     "content_html": "spread Renaissance ideas of humanism to the New World"
    }
